# 🚗 Healthcare Analysis Dashboard

Welcome to the **Healthcare Analysis Dashboard**!  
This Power BI project provides a deep dive into the usability of a healthcare tool used across multiple product lines, time periods, cities, and employees. The dashboard identifies sales trends, top-performing products, and key profitability metrics.

